WEBVTT

00:00:00.670 --> 00:00:04.040
<i>Main is ordered to become 
Karstedt's adoptive daughter.</i>

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:06.930
I can't!

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:10.470
I don't want to be apart 
from my family any longer.

00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:13.120
The enrollment age for the 
Royal Academy is ten.

00:00:13.470 --> 00:00:15.850
Until then, have your family 
spoil you as much as you'd like.

00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:18.620
<i>But meanwhile...</i>

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:21.970
You still can't find that child?

00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:28.900
Where the hell is she hiding?

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:44.520
<b>Ascendance of a Bookworm</b>

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:46.030
<b>Ascendance of a Bookworm</b>

00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:09.980
<b>Chapter Twenty-Nine
The Dedication Ceremony and Spring Arrives</b>

00:02:25.150 --> 00:02:29.610
<i>Starting today, I have a knight
 as my bodyguard.</i>

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:35.830
This is Sir Damuel.

00:02:36.090 --> 00:02:41.850
These are my attendants Fran, 
Gil, Rosina, and Delia.

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:43.990
It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:47.470
I'm Damuel. It is a pleasure to meet you.

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:52.130
Since you're a knight and a bodyguard, 
are you an upper-class noble?

00:02:52.130 --> 00:02:55.870
I'm very happy to become 
acquainted with one.

00:02:55.870 --> 00:02:58.910
Unfortunately, I'm a lesser noble.

00:02:58.910 --> 00:03:03.990
But I plan to do my job as 
her bodyguard well.

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:10.860
A knight?! That's awesome!

00:03:10.860 --> 00:03:13.120
A noble is Main's bodyguard?!

00:03:14.070 --> 00:03:16.660
Yes... I'm Damuel.

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:18.240
It's a pleasure.

00:03:18.530 --> 00:03:20.460
It's a pleasure to meet you!

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:23.630
Okay, I'm gonna head to the workshop.

00:03:23.830 --> 00:03:26.500
And I'll head to the cathedral classroom.

00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:31.220
<i>Tuuli is currently working very 
hard to learn how to read and write.</i>

00:03:37.430 --> 00:03:42.750
I'm so used to having other nobles look 
down on me, so I panicked a little.

00:03:43.520 --> 00:03:48.840
<i>If I'm adopted by a noble, this is 
the world I'll have to live in.</i>

00:03:49.300 --> 00:03:51.360
What are you going to do, 
Apprentice Priestess?

00:03:53.210 --> 00:03:54.260
What else?

00:03:54.540 --> 00:03:56.330
I'm going to the library!

00:03:56.640 --> 00:04:01.170
Now that I have a bodyguard, 
I got permission to move about!

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:05.180
Yahoo!

00:04:05.420 --> 00:04:08.090
Lady Main, the library is cold,

00:04:08.090 --> 00:04:11.300
so if you are there for a long period 
of time, it may affect your health.

00:04:11.300 --> 00:04:12.260
D'oh.

00:04:14.890 --> 00:04:18.160
Then perhaps all we need to do 
is ask Lord Ferdinand

00:04:18.160 --> 00:04:21.050
if she can bring books into her own room?

00:04:21.050 --> 00:04:22.130
I see.

00:04:23.660 --> 00:04:28.020
Er, I didn't mean to 
overstep my boundaries.

00:04:28.020 --> 00:04:29.200
My apologies.

00:04:29.460 --> 00:04:32.880
No, you are absolutely 
correct, Sir Damuel.

00:04:40.640 --> 00:04:44.850
Damuel fit right in with 
everyone else in no time.

00:04:45.620 --> 00:04:48.960
The high priest has departed to the 
palace for the Dedication Ceremony.

00:04:48.960 --> 00:04:54.200
In that case, please tell him that 
Main now has a new bodyguard.

00:04:54.490 --> 00:04:57.940
Though even if he is a bodyguard,
 he's of low standing,

00:04:57.940 --> 00:05:01.100
and can't seem to do anything 
other than awkwardly laugh.

00:05:01.460 --> 00:05:02.350
Jenni!

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:05.870
Sorry, I've got to go.

00:05:05.870 --> 00:05:10.440
Jenni! Make sure you tell the high 
priest I came by to report to him...

00:05:11.940 --> 00:05:16.430
Ugh! I came all this way and 
don't even get a reward!

00:05:24.700 --> 00:05:27.340
The room where the Dedication Ceremony

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:30.230
will take place is in the deepest 
part of the nobles' quarter.

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:39.330
The high priest...

00:06:05.710 --> 00:06:07.700
By the way, Head Priest,

00:06:07.700 --> 00:06:10.800
just what kind of ritual is 
the Dedication Ceremony?

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:15.650
The Dedication Ceremony is the most 
important ritual among the cathedral's events.

00:06:16.110 --> 00:06:21.340
You will take the small grail you received 
at the Harvest Festival and fill it with mana.

00:06:21.340 --> 00:06:24.370
This will determine how much 
harvest we will have.

00:06:24.370 --> 00:06:26.110
How much harvest we have?!

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:28.330
I'll do my best!

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:36.250
We are the ones who offer prayers and 
gratitude to the Gods who created this world.

00:06:37.180 --> 00:06:41.030
The King and Queen Gods that 
rule upon the sky so high

00:06:41.030 --> 00:06:43.210
are the Gods of Darkness and 
Light, husband and wife.

00:06:44.210 --> 00:06:49.200
The Eternal Five that 
rule upon this land...

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:51.830
The Goddess of Water, Fruhtrane.

00:06:51.830 --> 00:06:54.270
The God of Fire, Leidenschaft.

00:06:54.270 --> 00:06:56.990
The Goddess of Wind, Schutzaria.

00:06:56.990 --> 00:06:59.730
The Goddess of Earth, Geduldh.

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:02.410
The Goddess of Life, Ewigleben.

00:07:02.950 --> 00:07:08.410
We show our respect to the Gods 
who give all life their blessings...

00:07:08.410 --> 00:07:13.530
...and repay them for 
their divine blessings.

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:19.990
Main, that is enough.

00:07:26.720 --> 00:07:28.810
That was more than anticipated.

00:07:28.810 --> 00:07:30.960
They're red now.

00:07:30.960 --> 00:07:32.940
This will do for today.

00:07:33.900 --> 00:07:36.760
We have to fill all of those ourselves?

00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:38.150
Yes.

00:07:38.710 --> 00:07:42.750
Even though I have business 
in the nobles' district.

00:07:42.750 --> 00:07:44.880
Wouldn't it be easier if all the

00:07:44.880 --> 00:07:48.140
blue-robed priests just went "Bam!" 
and all contributed at once?

00:07:50.590 --> 00:07:53.000
The difference is mana is too great.

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:57.290
Though their mana flows easier 
when we say the prayer together,

00:07:57.690 --> 00:08:00.510
if they are influenced by 
how much mana you release,

00:08:00.510 --> 00:08:02.330
they will not last physically.

00:08:02.980 --> 00:08:04.290
Oh...

00:08:04.610 --> 00:08:08.480
You are the only one who can 
participate in this ritual with me.

00:08:15.350 --> 00:08:17.360
This is going to take forever.

00:08:20.130 --> 00:08:26.100
We are the ones who offer prayers and 
gratitude to the Gods who created this world.

00:08:29.080 --> 00:08:32.190
You seem to be praying really hard.

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:36.340
High Priest.

00:08:45.510 --> 00:08:47.090
What brings you here?

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:57.870
Main, offer some of your 
mana into these, as well.

00:08:58.370 --> 00:08:59.360
Huh?

00:08:59.360 --> 00:09:01.830
This is a request from the lord.

00:09:03.210 --> 00:09:05.760
Are you saying you can follow 
the orders of the head priest,

00:09:05.760 --> 00:09:09.640
but not my orders as the high priest?

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:17.020
I would be honored.

00:09:17.390 --> 00:09:20.720
Do not forget those words.

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:35.100
I was nervous that you 
might lose control again.

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:38.790
Well, I've grown, so...

00:09:43.010 --> 00:09:47.350
I do not believe that filling these 
grails is an order from the lord.

00:09:47.630 --> 00:09:48.390
Huh?

00:09:48.820 --> 00:09:51.060
I'll ask the lord and see for myself.

00:09:51.420 --> 00:09:53.830
But you should continue to be obedient

00:09:53.830 --> 00:09:56.350
to let the high priest believe 
he has the upper hand.

00:09:56.730 --> 00:09:57.760
Can I rely on you?

00:09:58.870 --> 00:10:02.440
I don't mind making you look 
good every once in a while.

00:10:04.930 --> 00:10:08.120
<i>And so, the Dedication Ceremony 
ended without issue.</i>

00:10:08.760 --> 00:10:13.170
<i>At the end of winter, Rosina had 
her coming-of-age ceremony</i>

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:14.980
<i>and we all celebrated.</i>

00:10:25.020 --> 00:10:26.850
This smell is definitely something...

00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:28.990
Welcome to our parts.

00:10:28.990 --> 00:10:30.860
You'll just have to get used to it.

00:10:30.860 --> 00:10:35.590
This is the assignment the 
head priest gave you, right?

00:10:35.590 --> 00:10:37.840
If you're going to be my bodyguard,

00:10:37.840 --> 00:10:40.240
we'll be coming down here 
every now and then.

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:44.560
What a rather difficult assignment.

00:10:45.530 --> 00:10:48.610
Sir, Lady Main has arrived.

00:11:02.210 --> 00:11:03.300
What do you think?

00:11:09.030 --> 00:11:10.740
<i>The most important thing...</i>

00:11:10.740 --> 00:11:14.650
<i>is that these letter types are 
all the same size and height...</i>

00:11:15.530 --> 00:11:17.290
What do you think, little lady?

00:11:17.620 --> 00:11:19.570
Is this what you wanted?

00:11:25.750 --> 00:11:28.820
They're wonderful! Truly Gutenberg!

00:11:28.820 --> 00:11:29.860
Huh?

00:11:30.300 --> 00:11:34.700
I give you the title of Gutenberg, Johann!

00:11:34.700 --> 00:11:35.850
Guten...?

00:11:36.140 --> 00:11:37.790
Main, calm down.

00:11:37.790 --> 00:11:40.300
No, you need to be more excited, Lutz!

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:43.800
Gutenberg's first name is Johannes, 
and we have Johann here!

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:47.390
What a lovely coincidence! Truly a miracle!

00:11:49.280 --> 00:11:51.270
We offer the gods our prayers!

00:11:51.920 --> 00:11:54.760
So what's this Gutenwhatsit?

00:11:54.760 --> 00:11:58.620
A great person who caused a huge turning point 
in the history of books. He's basically a god!

00:11:58.890 --> 00:12:00.540
He's absolutely amazing!

00:12:00.540 --> 00:12:02.100
Johann... no.

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:06.090
Everyone involved with 
bookmaking is Gutenberg!

00:12:06.090 --> 00:12:07.980
We're all in this together!

00:12:08.590 --> 00:12:09.990
Well, I want no part of this.

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:14.900
I offer the Goddess of Wisdom, 
Mestionora, my thanks.

00:12:15.910 --> 00:12:17.030
Lady Main!

00:12:19.070 --> 00:12:22.510
<i>I think... I might actually 
be executed this time.</i>

00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:24.510
Main, are you okay?

00:12:23.100 --> 00:12:24.280
Lady Main!

00:12:27.010 --> 00:12:30.930
<b>Ascendance of a
 Bookworm</b>

00:12:33.090 --> 00:12:37.020
<b>Ascendance of a
 Bookworm</b>

00:12:43.300 --> 00:12:46.760
Head Priest, the snow is starting to melt,

00:12:46.760 --> 00:12:50.560
so I'd like to go home sometime soon.

00:13:00.040 --> 00:13:03.400
I actually received word 
that Wolf has died.

00:13:03.770 --> 00:13:04.670
Huh?

00:13:07.530 --> 00:13:12.940
We found out just when I had asked Karstedt 
to look into who Wolf's client was.

00:13:15.500 --> 00:13:18.150
So some noble is behind this?

00:13:18.550 --> 00:13:19.630
It would seem so.

00:13:21.530 --> 00:13:22.820
And they're after...

00:13:23.640 --> 00:13:24.850
me?

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:28.750
Give this to your family for me.

00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:34.430
Head Priest, this is...

00:13:35.310 --> 00:13:36.520
I'm counting on you.

00:13:39.560 --> 00:13:41.500
As you wish...

00:13:49.660 --> 00:13:51.170
For her safety,

00:13:51.170 --> 00:13:55.550
we'll be keeping Main at the cathedral 
until the Spring Prayer is done.

00:13:55.550 --> 00:14:00.490
But our agreement was to only 
keep her through the winter.

00:14:00.490 --> 00:14:02.070
I can't agree to this.

00:14:02.480 --> 00:14:04.770
Right now is the most dangerous time.

00:14:05.360 --> 00:14:09.060
This would be the worst time 
for Main to get kidnapped.

00:14:09.060 --> 00:14:10.700
Kidnapped?

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:13.930
Main's mana was far greater 
than I had anticipated.

00:14:14.400 --> 00:14:18.380
It is essential for this 
city that lacks mana,

00:14:18.380 --> 00:14:20.590
but there are nobles who will resent her.

00:14:21.270 --> 00:14:23.360
And you're saying a noble is after Main?

00:14:23.800 --> 00:14:29.210
Yes. Whether it be from this domain or 
another is something I'm uncertain of for now.

00:14:29.820 --> 00:14:36.400
That's why I've had the lord and the knights 
limit how often the nobles can move about.

00:14:36.950 --> 00:14:40.430
There should've been a change regarding 
nobles entering and exiting the gate as well.

00:14:40.720 --> 00:14:42.800
Yes, I'm aware of it.

00:14:43.330 --> 00:14:45.490
That was for Main?

00:14:45.490 --> 00:14:46.440
Yes.

00:14:47.100 --> 00:14:48.740
Why would you go that far?

00:14:49.040 --> 00:14:50.570
I told you.

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:53.250
We need Main's mana.

00:14:54.150 --> 00:14:55.360
Her mana?

00:14:58.300 --> 00:14:59.990
On that note, I'd like to 
discuss something with you.

00:15:00.530 --> 00:15:04.170
Once Main turns ten, I will 
have her adopted by a noble.

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:05.870
Adopted by a noble?!

00:15:06.230 --> 00:15:07.940
This has already been decided.

00:15:08.830 --> 00:15:12.140
Main's mana is unbelievably great.

00:15:12.470 --> 00:15:16.960
But if she can't control it, she is a 
danger to herself and those around her.

00:15:17.700 --> 00:15:21.650
If she is deemed dangerous,
 Main will be dealt with.

00:15:21.650 --> 00:15:23.210
Dealt with?!

00:15:23.210 --> 00:15:27.780
It's only natural to eliminate something 
dangerous in order to protect the city.

00:15:28.240 --> 00:15:31.950
You are a soldier. I'm sure that idea 
isn't foreign to you, Gunther.

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:40.020
In order to keep that from happening, she 
needs to learn how to control her mana.

00:15:40.530 --> 00:15:42.600
That is why she will be adopted.

00:15:43.140 --> 00:15:46.060
Until she's ten years old and can 
enroll in the Royal Academy...

00:15:46.060 --> 00:15:47.800
she may spend time with her family.

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:53.610
But once she turns ten, she will either 
be adopted by a noble, or executed.

00:15:53.610 --> 00:15:55.050
Those are the only options.

00:15:56.570 --> 00:15:59.440
The noble is one I'm well-acquainted with.

00:16:00.330 --> 00:16:02.270
I will make sure she is treated well.

00:16:02.760 --> 00:16:04.220
That I can promise.

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:09.980
This is to protect your daughter.

00:16:12.170 --> 00:16:17.080
All right. We will leave 
Main in your hands.

00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:18.440
Effa!

00:16:18.440 --> 00:16:21.200
When it was first decided that Main 
would stay at the cathedral,

00:16:21.200 --> 00:16:26.080
I didn't think that would be 
possible due to how weak Main is.

00:16:26.470 --> 00:16:32.590
But Tuuli had informed me that Main 
was doing well thanks to all of you.

00:16:33.280 --> 00:16:36.470
I'm sure it's all because of your 
consideration, Head Priest.

00:16:37.590 --> 00:16:42.100
Head Priest, please continue 
to look after Main.

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:44.270
But her getting adopted is just...

00:16:44.590 --> 00:16:49.870
There are even dapla apprentices 
that leave their homes at ten.

00:16:49.870 --> 00:16:53.850
I'd prefer that to Main losing her life.

00:16:56.590 --> 00:16:58.110
True...

00:17:08.720 --> 00:17:11.930
I don't want to turn ten.

00:17:32.590 --> 00:17:36.020
The preparations for the Spring 
Prayer aren't even done yet.

00:17:36.620 --> 00:17:38.830
Ugh. Where could she have gone to?

00:17:39.230 --> 00:17:40.870
Lady Main!

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:47.920
Next, I want a printing press.

00:17:48.350 --> 00:17:51.390
And how are you going to 
make a printing press?

00:17:51.390 --> 00:17:54.690
I'm planning on modifying 
a regular press.

00:17:56.420 --> 00:17:58.040
<i>Observing her this closely...</i>

00:17:58.040 --> 00:18:01.050
I can definitely tell that the 
apprentice priestess is unique.

00:18:01.550 --> 00:18:04.440
If she wants to live in peace.

00:18:04.440 --> 00:18:07.670
being under Lord Karstedt's 
protection is probably the best.

00:18:08.060 --> 00:18:12.610
Oh? You're defending Main now, too?

00:18:13.190 --> 00:18:16.400
Looks like you're getting used 
to Main and the cathedral.

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:23.440
Even now, I think it would've been better 
if Schicicoza was not her guard.

00:18:24.360 --> 00:18:27.760
Because of that incident, I was demoted,

00:18:27.760 --> 00:18:30.160
and my engagement was called off.

00:18:31.480 --> 00:18:36.150
It is incorrect for you to assume that you 
were punished because of Schicicoza.

00:18:36.150 --> 00:18:36.860
Huh?

00:18:38.150 --> 00:18:40.930
You have your own crimes.

00:18:42.050 --> 00:18:46.110
Damuel, you should have
 immediately cast "rot."

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:47.940
Rot?

00:18:48.430 --> 00:18:53.400
When things are out of your control, you need to cast rot so that others know.

00:18:53.400 --> 00:18:56.690
If you had been guarding an upper-class noble,
 or a princess from another domain,

00:18:56.690 --> 00:18:58.500
that is what you would've done.

00:18:58.990 --> 00:18:59.950
Am I wrong?

00:19:00.870 --> 00:19:03.810
Before falling to the threats 
of a middle-class noble,

00:19:03.810 --> 00:19:06.270
you should asked for help from 
someone of higher rank.

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:10.110
Not only did you fail at that, 
you failed your mission.

00:19:10.110 --> 00:19:13.990
Lamenting, "Oh, woe is me," regarding 
this is also one off your crimes.

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:16.340
You fool.

00:19:18.450 --> 00:19:21.810
There are some unsettling rumors 
surrounding the Spring Prayer.

00:19:22.460 --> 00:19:24.100
Know that any bizarre

00:19:24.100 --> 00:19:28.170
sense of pride, or obsequious words
 or actions, will do you no good.

00:19:28.580 --> 00:19:32.030
Yes, sir. This time, I will not fail in 
protecting the apprentice priestess.

00:19:36.530 --> 00:19:40.600
What? The high priest isn't 
going to the Spring Prayer?

00:19:41.380 --> 00:19:45.250
Unlike the Harvest Festival, 
there will be no donations.

00:19:46.300 --> 00:19:49.570
<i>So the fact that he's making me 
go to a ritual without donations</i>

00:19:49.570 --> 00:19:51.950
<i>is definitely harassment.</i>

00:19:51.950 --> 00:19:54.430
And who will be accompanying you?

00:19:55.340 --> 00:19:59.430
Fran, Rosina, Hugo, and Ella.

00:19:59.430 --> 00:20:00.860
So four, then.

00:20:01.280 --> 00:20:03.090
Um, Head Priest.

00:20:03.090 --> 00:20:06.750
We'll be going around for ten days 
for the Spring Prayer, right?

00:20:07.310 --> 00:20:11.660
I'm pretty sure I'm going 
to get sick at some point.

00:20:11.660 --> 00:20:14.790
Hm. You will probably 
need a lot of medicine.

00:20:14.790 --> 00:20:17.320
<i>That super-gross medicine...</i>

00:20:17.620 --> 00:20:20.410
Couldn't you at least do 
something about the taste?

00:20:21.110 --> 00:20:23.640
You seem to feel very strongly about this.

00:20:24.380 --> 00:20:26.250
I'll give it some thought.

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:29.620
Thank you very much.

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:31.530
Also, just in case...

00:20:32.060 --> 00:20:34.180
Wear these.

00:20:36.800 --> 00:20:39.570
<i>And then, the morning of 
the Spring Prayer...</i>

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:45.390
I hate to say this...

00:20:46.870 --> 00:20:49.440
But more people will be accompanying you.

00:20:53.300 --> 00:20:55.310
Lord Karstedt.

00:21:00.690 --> 00:21:04.070
<i>Have I ever seen this 
blue-robed priest before?</i>

00:21:05.600 --> 00:21:09.580
You're so puny. Has her 
baptism actually happened?

00:21:15.530 --> 00:21:18.450
Squeak "pwee" for me.

00:21:18.970 --> 00:21:20.020
Sorry, what?

00:22:53.970 --> 00:22:56.980
<b>Next Chapter
Spring Prayer</b>

00:22:57.250 --> 00:23:00.710
Mister Benno, I'll buy you a souvenir 
during the Spring Prayer,

00:23:00.710 --> 00:23:02.670
so look forward to it.

00:23:02.670 --> 00:23:04.590
I'm more concerned about the restaurant.

00:23:04.590 --> 00:23:08.190
It's almost finished, but 
you haven't shown up once.

00:23:08.190 --> 00:23:10.510
Well, I'm busy.

00:23:10.510 --> 00:23:14.800
Whatever. Help me come up with ways of 
avoiding any dine-and-dashers and theft.

00:23:14.800 --> 00:23:15.810
In that case...

00:23:15.700 --> 00:23:35.010
<b>No referral, no entry</b>

00:23:16.580 --> 00:23:18.910
make it so no one can come 
without a referral.

00:23:18.910 --> 00:23:20.580
A... referral?

00:23:20.580 --> 00:23:22.670
It's a kind of invitation.

00:23:22.670 --> 00:23:25.690
If someone who was invited causes an issue,

00:23:25.690 --> 00:23:28.420
the one who invited them 
will take responsibility.

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:32.340
You're sounding more and more 
like a merchant every day.

00:23:32.340 --> 00:23:34.730
I finally got some praise!

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.010
Illustration by: Moto Naoko
